//
// Qwen3.5-0.8B Q4NX decode compile-only smoke test: builds the full ELF of
// programming_examples/fused_decode_gdn (the fused_decode fork this model's
// decode runs on) through the AIR -> AIE -> aiecc -> Peano pipeline. No NPU
// dispatch and no weight data (weights are runtime buffers). The fork has no
// lit of its own; like fused_decode_ple's, its compile gate lives with the
// model that uses it. Pairs with run_npu2_compile_fused_prefill.lit (the
// prefill half) and run_npu2_verify.lit (the correctness gate).
//
// Built at the smallest production capacity (1024): the Gated DeltaNet herd's
// channels and the memtile hand-offs lower and link the same way at every
// capacity.
//
// REQUIRES: ryzen_ai_npu2, peano, peano_ge22, llvm_link_pre23
//
// RUN: mkdir -p test_npu2_compile
// RUN: cd test_npu2_compile
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile clean
// RUN: make -f %S/Makefile compile-decode CAPACITIES=1024 PEANO_INSTALL_DIR=%PEANO_INSTALL_DIR | FileCheck %s
// CHECK: fused_decode_gdn full-ELF build complete
